             :plan "occurred-since returns each touched error's recorded observation with its references and resolution instead of a signature/message/count summary, and resolution never hides a fault from its window; for-agent reaches the escalation owner of a fault no steward answers for (audit §2.5 items 5-6). Read `seon.error/for-agent`, `seon.error/occurred-since` and `docs/research/agent-platform/error-delivery-audit-2026-09-26.md`."}
 #:seon.task{:name "error-transactions-carry-references-never-worlds"
